title: "Six values of an extremal prime-race function recover an Euler factor"
abstract: "Under Dirichlet GRH, recover the local Euler factors of the 547/727 field from six limiting prime-race curvature values. Without GRH the same inversion applies to the explicit-formula sum over zeros."
